      "text": "Will choose SSE (one-way server to brower flow)\n\nUse WebSocket when the client also needs:\n\nsubscriptions that change frequently\nbidirectional control messages\ncollaborative interactions\nmultiplexed high-frequency streams",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Will choose SSE (one-way server to brower flow)\n\nUse WebSocket when the client also needs:\n\nsubscriptions that change frequently\nbidirectional control messages\ncollaborative interactions\nmultiplexed high-frequency streams",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
